"若启用 iCloud 照片，删除会同步到同一账户的其他设备；若为共享图库，共享成员可能看到相应变化。照片通常会按系统设置进入“最近删除”，具体保留时间和恢复条件由系统决定。" = "If iCloud Photos is enabled, deletion syncs to other devices using the same account. Shared Library participants may see the change. Items normally move to Recently Deleted; retention and recovery depend on Photos settings.";
"有 %lld 项本地处理记录当前无法在照片图库中找到。" = "%lld saved review records are currently inaccessible in Photos.";
"有 %lld 项相簿整理记录暂时无法访问。" = "%lld pending album changes are temporarily inaccessible.";
"无法保存本组顺序；本次仍可继续整理，下次可能需要重新排序。" = "This group’s order could not be saved. You can continue this session, but the next session may use a different order.";
"%lld 张暂无本地预览，仍可按月份审核，无需下载。" = "%lld photos have no local preview. You can review by month without downloading.";

