/* iCloud preview preference and first-use explanation */
"自动下载 iCloud 原片" = "Automatically Download iCloud Originals";
"开启后，浏览照片时允许从 iCloud 下载高清内容" = "Allow high-quality photos to download from iCloud while viewing them";
"默认关闭，iCloud 照片使用本地缩略图。开启后，正在查看的照片会自动下载原片以显示高清内容，可能消耗流量和设备空间；不会批量下载整个图库。" = "Off by default: iCloud photos use local thumbnails. When enabled, the photo you are viewing automatically downloads for a high-quality preview. This may use data and device storage; your entire library will not be downloaded.";
"iCloud 照片默认使用缩略图" = "iCloud Photos Use Thumbnails by Default";
"默认不自动下载原片，减少流量和设备空间占用。" = "Originals do not download automatically by default, saving data and device storage.";
"能辨认，就能整理" = "Recognize It, Review It";
"缩略图可能较模糊，但能辨认内容就可以保留、待删或稍后决定，无需等待原片。" = "Thumbnails may look blurry. If you can recognize the content, you can keep it, mark it for deletion, or decide later without waiting for the original.";
"需要高清时再开启" = "Enable Downloads When You Need Detail";
"到“设置”开启“自动下载 iCloud 原片”，正在查看的照片才会自动加载高清内容；可能消耗流量和设备空间。" = "In Settings, turn on “Automatically Download iCloud Originals” to load high-quality content for the photo you are viewing. This may use data and device storage.";
"播放与导出按需加载" = "Playback and Export Load on Demand";
"即使关闭自动下载，主动播放视频或实况、分享、转为静态照片时，仍可能下载所需内容。" = "Even with automatic downloads off, playing a video or Live Photo, sharing, or creating a still photo may download the content needed.";
"iCloud 照片默认使用本地缩略图，不自动下载原片；需要高清内容时，可在设置开启。" = "iCloud photos use local thumbnails by default. Originals do not download automatically; enable this in Settings when you need high-quality content.";
"双指或下方按钮放大并拖动查看；已开启 iCloud 原片自动下载。" = "Pinch or use the buttons below to zoom, then drag to pan. Automatic iCloud original downloads are enabled.";
"照片暂时无法加载" = "Photo Temporarily Unavailable";
"正在加载高清照片…" = "Loading high-quality photo…";

