"相似照片按画面分组；截图只挑出超过 90 天且像临时信息的内容；副本必须原始文件完全相同。每张都由你决定。" = "Similar photos share a scene or composition. Screenshots must be over 90 days old and contain temporary details. Copies must have identical original files. You decide what to keep.";
"相似画面、超过 90 天的临时截图，以及原始文件完全相同的副本。点分类查看筛选依据。" = "Similar scenes, temporary screenshots over 90 days old, and files with identical originals. Open a category to see why.";
"同一场景连拍或画面很接近的照片会放在一起。修图版和原图可以都留。" = "Shots of the same scene or very similar images appear together. You can keep both an edit and its original.";
"只看超过 90 天、有明确临时信息的截图，例如订单结果、取件码、验证码、已送达物流、过期活动或优惠券；逐张判断是否还需要。" = "Only screenshots over 90 days old with clear temporary details appear here, such as order results, pickup or verification codes, delivered packages, past events, and expired coupons. Review them one by one.";
"只有原始文件内容完全相同才算副本。修图软件导出的照片不会仅凭画面相似被当成副本。" = "Copies have identical original file contents. An edited export is not a copy just because it looks similar.";
